{"t":"IT","made":"2026-11-11 10:29","name":"Gartner, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Information Technology Services","employees":19460,"hq":"Stamford, CT, United States","website":"https://www.gartner.com","summary_en":"Gartner, Inc. provides business and technology insights to support decision-making and performance on an organization's mission-critical priorities in the United States, Canada, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and internationally. It operates through three segments: Insights, Conferences, and Consulting. The Insights segment delivers insights through subscription services, such as access to published content, data and benchmarks, and direct access to a network of business and technology experts. The Conferences segment enables executives and teams to learn, share, and network through its Symposium/Xpo series and peer-driven sessions, as well as through its conferences focused on specific business roles and topics. The Consulting segment provides technology-driven strategic initiatives, including custom analysis and on-the-ground support to senior executives. This segment also offers actionable solutions for IT-related priorities, including IT cost optimization, digital transformation, and IT sourcing optimization. The company was formerly known as Gartner Group, Inc. and changed its name to Gartner, Inc. in November 2001. Gartner, Inc. was founded in 1979 and is headquartered in Stamford, Connecticut.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Gartner, Inc.는 미국, 캐나다, 유럽, 중동, 아프리카 및 국제적으로 조직의 중요 업무 우선 순위에 대한 의사 결정 및 성과를 지원하기 위한 비즈니스 및 기술 통찰력을 제공합니다. Insights, Conferences 및 Consulting의 세 가지 부문으로 운영됩니다. Insights 부문은 게시된 콘텐츠, 데이터 및 벤치마크에 대한 액세스, 비즈니스 및 기술 전문가 네트워크에 대한 직접 액세스와 같은 구독 서비스를 통해 통찰력을 제공합니다. 컨퍼런스 부문에서는 임원과 팀이 심포지엄/Xpo 시리즈 및 동료 중심 세션은 물론 특정 비즈니스 역할 및 주제에 초점을 맞춘 컨퍼런스를 통해 학습, 공유 및 네트워크를 형성할 수 있습니다. 컨설팅 부문은 고위 경영진에 대한 맞춤형 분석 및 현장 지원을 포함하여 기술 중심의 전략적 이니셔티브를 제공합니다. 이 부문은 또한 IT 비용 최적화, 디지털 전환, IT 소싱 최적화 등 IT 관련 우선순위에 대한 실행 가능한 솔루션을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Gartner Group, Inc.로 알려져 있었으며 2001년 11월에 Gartner, Inc.로 이름을 변경했습니다. Gartner, Inc.는 1979년에 설립되었으며 코네티컷주 스탬포드에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":188.92,"mcap":11917329408.0,"pe":13.532951,"fpe":11.364928,"peg":0.7259,"ps":1.8492694,"pb":-346.64218,"ev_ebitda":9.569,"div":0.0,"beta":0.912,"hi52":256.9,"lo52":124.25},"fin":{"rev":6444344832.0,"rev_g":-0.013,"eps_g":6.128,"gross":0.70176005,"op":0.18581,"net":0.1481,"roe":3.65755,"fcf":1067743104.0,"cash":1633137024.0,"debt":3313460992.0,"de":null,"eps":13.96,"feps":16.62307},"own":{"short":0.1463,"inst":1.20123,"insider":0.02674},"analyst":{"n":13,"mean":201.46153,"median":198.0,"high":231.0,"low":170.0,"rec":"hold","recMean":3.0,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":0,"buy":2,"hold":10,"sell":1,"strongSell":2},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":0,"buy":3,"hold":9,"sell":1,"strongSell":2},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":0,"buy":3,"hold":10,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":0,"buy":3,"hold":10,"sell":1,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-06","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Underweight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"down","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":185.0,"priorPriceTarget":150.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":220.0,"priorPriceTarget":208.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"Morgan Stanley","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":192.0,"priorPriceTarget":182.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"Goldman Sachs","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":207.0,"priorPriceTarget":181.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"Truist Securities","ToGrade":"Hold","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"down","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":210.0,"priorPriceTarget":235.0},{"GradeDa